/* DoL-MP v1.2.0-dev8: mp-job-seasonal-and-failures-2.twee (20 passages: 12 Job Extra + 8 Job Partner 2) */
:: MP Job Extra Cafe 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>梅雨午后的海风咖啡馆座无虚席，<<else>>午市高峰的海风咖啡馆座无虚席，<</if>>吧台蒸汽奶泡机的泄压阀突然塞住，一位赶时间的报社记者正催促他的热拿铁。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobExtra_cafe_1 is 1>>
这处暗格今天已经仔细查验过，眼下并无新的动静。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看后续差事 (0:03)|MP Job Extra Cafe 2]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[动手抢修 (0:02)|MP Job Extra Cafe 1 A]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[借用器具 (0:02)|MP Job Extra Cafe 1 B]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Extra Cafe 1 A [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
你端稳托盘快步上前，准备趁热气散尽前稳住咖啡馆前厅的突发状况。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回现场 (0:02)|MP Job Extra Cafe 1]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-job-extra-cafe-1-a">
<<tendingicon>><<link "疏通蒸汽嘴 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-job-extra-cafe-1-a">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_extra_cafe_1_money_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 1520>><</if>>白汽重新绵密喷出，你拉出漂亮的心形奶泡端上桌，记者满意地多留了小费。<span class="green">你及时排除了奶泡机故障。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[应对下一件 (0:04)|MP Job Extra Cafe 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	高温蒸汽喷了手背一下，记者不耐烦地看了眼怀表。<span class="red">手背被蒸汽熏红了一小块。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Job Extra Cafe 1 A]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回岗位 (0:03)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Extra Cafe 1 B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
你扫了一眼吧台内侧的备用器具，打算借巧劲化解眼前的忙乱。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回现场 (0:02)|MP Job Extra Cafe 1]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-job-extra-cafe-1-b">
<<link "手动打奶泡 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-job-extra-cafe-1-b">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_extra_cafe_1_keepsake_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><</if>>手打奶泡同样细腻醇厚，记者尝了一口连声称赞，在碟下压了几枚硬币。<span class="green">你用娴熟手艺稳住了急客。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[忙完后半班 (0:04)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	手腕摇得发酸，奶泡还是有些粗散，只能向客人赔笑致歉。<span class="red">赶制手打奶泡让你手臂酸麻。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Job Extra Cafe 1 B]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回岗位 (0:03)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
